# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `pnpm dev:intelligence`.
#
# The operations brief agent runs on `openai/gpt-5.6-luna`. The Flue runtime
# resolves the OpenAI credential from `process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY`, which
# `nodejs_compat` populates from this Worker binding. Deployed environments get
# it from Wrangler secret storage instead:
#
#   pnpm exec wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY --env staging
#
# The repository-root `.env.local` holds the shared development value.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-replace-with-a-real-openai-key
